B.a2I=new A.m5("1. Create your account",'Open the app or web portal, tap "New company? Create account", enter your official email and a strong password, then sign in.',"assets/guide/01_login.png")
B.a2G=new A.m5("2. Start the free trial","Register your company on the Novature HRMS website (web app) to start the 1-month free trial. You become the Company Admin and can then sign in here.","assets/guide/02_admin_dashboard.png")
B.a2D=new A.m5("3. Follow the setup checklist",'Home \u2192 "Finish company setup". Steps are numbered; the next one is highlighted. Each step opens the right CSV upload.',"assets/guide/03_setup_checklist.png")
B.a2E=new A.m5("4. Upload CSV files in order","Download each sample CSV, replace the sample rows with your data (keep headings), save as CSV UTF-8 and upload. Mistakes are listed by row number before anything is saved.","assets/guide/04_csv_check.png")
B.a2B=new A.m5("5. Share logins with employees","Employee logins are created automatically from CSV 03 with the temporary password novature@123. Employees must set a new password at first login.","assets/guide/05_employee_home.png")
